# SQS Standard queues of messaging v2 section 1 (interpretations: PLAT-IV-013 a).
# Physical name of each role = environment variable <ROLE>_NAME.
# Dead-letter queues are listed first: their ARN feeds the RedrivePolicy of the main queue.
# "-" = attribute not set at creation (the wait time must then read back as the SQS default 0) / no redrive.
#
# role               VisibilityTimeout ReceiveMessageWaitTimeSeconds MessageRetentionPeriod DelaySeconds maxReceiveCount deadLetterRole
ORDERS_DLQ           60                -                             1209600                0            -               -
PROVISIONING_DLQ     120               -                             1209600                0            -               -
ORDERS_QUEUE         60                20                            3600                   0            5               ORDERS_DLQ
PROVISIONING_QUEUE   120               20                            86400                  0            5               PROVISIONING_DLQ
